# Class: <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/PAIN_0010237> (temporomandibular joint pain attributed to non-systemic arthritis)

AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/PAIN_0010237> "Temporomandibular joint pain due to arthritis with evidence of systemic inflammatory joint disease but not evidence that associates it with the TMJ pain or no evidence of rheumatological disease.")
