# Class: <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/PAIN_0010288> (constant unilateral facial pain with additional attacks (CUFPA))

AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/PAIN_0010288> "Constant (unremitting) dull unilateral facial pain of mild to moderate intensity, accompanied by distinct attacks of moderate to severe pain in the same location lasting 10--30 minutes. There are no typical autonomic and/or migrainoid features accompanying either the constant pain or the additional pain attacks.")
AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/PAIN_0010288> "PMID:32103673")
